<Base title="Free Spreadsheet & CSV Tools" description="Clean duplicate CSV rows locally and find useful Excel or Google Sheets formulas. Free browser tools with clear limits, no uploads, and no account." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Tools',url:'/tools/'}]}><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A practical toolkit</p><h1>A little less busywork.</h1><p>Two focused tools, with transparent inputs and results. Your files stay in your browser.</p></header><div class="tool-grid section"><section class="panel"><span class="category-icon" aria-hidden="true">≋</span><h2>CSV Duplicate Checker</h2><p>Preview a CSV, choose the columns that define a match, and keep the first row. Review the rows to remove before downloading the cleaned file.</p><p>UTF-8 comma-separated files only. No XLSX upload or encoding detection claim.</p><a class="button" href="/tools/csv-duplicate-checker/">Check your CSV ↗</a></section><section class="panel"><span class="category-icon" aria-hidden="true">ƒx</span><h2>Formula Finder</h2><p>Search eight everyday functions by purpose and spreadsheet app. See syntax, sample input, expected output, and the official source.</p><p>A curated reference library. It does not execute formulas.</p><a class="button" href="/tools/formula-finder/">Find a formula ↗</a></section></div></Base>
